# Text files are stored with LF in the repository and checked out however the
# contributor's git is set up to (core.autocrlf / core.eol). This writes down
# what was already happening on the machines that had autocrlf on, so it stops
# depending on that setting -- it does not force LF into anyone's working tree.
* text=auto

# Never touch these, whatever their bytes look like.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ttf binary
*.vtf binary
*.mdl binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
